# Cargo.lock is deliberately NOT ignored here, and the same holds in the root
# `fuzz/` directory since #611 — both fuzz workspaces track their lockfile.
# Each is its own cargo workspace, so no Dependabot entry reaches it; tracking
# the lockfile is what makes divergence from the workspace detectable at all.
# `just check-fuzz-lock-parity` gates both on every PR — see README.md and
# docs/ADR/0011-fuzz-lockfile-workspace-parity.md.
